  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1. Modified: DbServiceBase Class, the data model property labeled with [AutoIncrement] attribute will be excluded from the Update() method by default from now on.\n2. Add: DbServiceBase.IncludeAutoIncrementField() method to manually specify that the data model property labeled with [AutoIncrement] attribute should not be excluded from the following Insert() or Update() method.\n3. Enhance: The safeguard checking for the existence of where condition in SQL script for Update(), Delete() and ExecuteSQL() methods of DbServiceBase, originally checking for \" where \", now checking for \"where \".",
